        "kind": "example",
        "title": "Sample variance from a multivariate delta method",
        "statement": "For iid real X with a finite fourth absolute moment, the sample variance S_n\u00b2=Q_n\u2212\\bar X_n\u00b2 has a Gaussian root-n limit with variance E[(X\u2212\u03bc\u2081)^4]\u2212\u03c3^4=\u03bc\u2084\u22124\u03bc\u2081\u03bc\u2083+8\u03bc\u2081\u00b2\u03bc\u2082\u22124\u03bc\u2081^4\u2212\u03bc\u2082\u00b2; AC is assumed through the multivariate iid CLT.",
